SUMMARY:New Moon in Cancer Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin Senseful Wellness at Beaver Lake for
  some astrology explanation and Cancer New Moon inspired yoga flow.\nMeet 
 Senseful Wellness at the Botanical Gardens by UNCA for a yoga class themed
  around the new moon in Gemini.\n\nTogether we will :\n\\- Disccuss what t
 he New Moon is asking from us\n\\- Flow through a New Moon inspired sequen
 ce\n\\- Journal & Reflect on the New Moon\n\nWhat to bring:\nJournal & Pen
 \nWater\n\nWe will have Yoga Mats and additional props but you are welcome
  to bring your own.\n\nThis is a Donation Based Event\nRecommended Donatio
 n $20 - $25
